623335", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ayz7tTJAD_cQ7kNvwErIK28&_nc_oc=AdrINmfPDk4vnT07Bu9PC-_Lp_GH2eb3DXALtr2C5UXhK2m8vzorfcqHvpXuWI-7TLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHB9z9T-YKiJ4CmydE4cMee_RL2IgPc5At_tPUiFYUESw&oe=6A81BA62"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R3HapIUmuP0Q7kNvwFsak71&_nc_oc=AdrPe_ZaG2T98HxcEfxzLC8sW39yrESZ05479H1JTW2RTczvA2_FXNdAEuIa9e7HODg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFtvFOElyY1WBz5F5j-w810pm04_pZwU_9y7lb8FGgJaQ&oe=6A818FB3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5jFR3eFqiswQ7kNvwGLFavo&_nc_oc=AdruP86DuVZz-kt7MGxMNars3TeRhC4tE7C9QmGfha4LLGo37sh5LK7UXVG4EngbG2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHk77JCQdpCbJB9d6QnCSUFc1DepzOypZK5SK_zMDkxlQ&oe=6A81BC6B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XkwVpbXzxN0Q7kNvwF1aeA4&_nc_oc=Adp8RZuDXEpqeHrbB9V0q7NjEqdLVGjY1FSSgkg4lap_lWuDEVHK7dEbG9bQ0yrtswI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEKxJnJ5FIxUdZ_hGCA4lEXErw-hjWLS3ttNIVQ-h9ijg&oe=6A81A162"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e1DGUAepTT8Q7kNvwFUq6ak&_nc_oc=AdrECMmBD1c5lN2mMUOMil-O0V_DY99igy8a18B5gDT-i3eg9BgYkkUyQn-tLGzLVAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHzkDTtKqXJx88Qk_puSD8ig3NlStLBh6rd77pH2kMchw&oe=6A81A3FD"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292